{"id":"8dd111dd979ae61f","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check.md","title":"缺少最终同余检查时的合数反例 9","display":"ex-primality-missing-fermat-check — 缺少最终同余检查时的合数反例 9","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check","aliases":["73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check"],"display":"ex-primality-missing-fermat-check — 缺少最终同余检查时的合数反例 9","depends_on":["[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26 proof step 4, print p. 520; PDF p. 542; verified local counterexample","source_status":"source-scan-checked; explicit counterexample to incomplete listed algorithm","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-primality-missing-fermat-check — 缺少最终同余检查时的合数反例 9"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" href=\"?note=ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" title=\"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion\">73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26 proof step 4, print p. 520; PDF p. 542; verified local counterexample"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-scan-checked; explicit counterexample to incomplete listed algorithm"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow},\\operatorname{Prime},\\operatorname{Composite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pow},\\operatorname{Prime},\\operatorname{Composite}\\)</span> 采用已列依赖；候选素因子列表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle2,2,2\\rangle\">\\(\\langle2,2,2\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Composite}(9)\\land 9-1=2\\cdot2\\cdot2\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,(9-1)/2)=7\\ne1\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,9-1)=4\\ne1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Composite}(9)\\land 9-1=2\\cdot2\\cdot2\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,(9-1)/2)=7\\ne1\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,9-1)=4\\ne1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三版 p.520 的步骤 4 仅列出 x^((p−1)/q)≠1。取 p=9、x=2、因子列表 (2,2,2)，其列出的所有递归因子检查及排小阶检查都通过，却并非素数。新增的 x^(p−1)=1 正好拒绝此反例。已查看 PDF p.542 扫描图确认该条件确实未显式列出，不是文字层漏识别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow},\\operatorname{Prime},\\operatorname{Composite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle2,2,2\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Composite}(9)\\land 9-1=2\\cdot2\\cdot2\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,(9-1)/2)=7\\ne1\n\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_9(2,9-1)=4\\ne1.","display":true}],"bytes":1498,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-primality-missing-fermat-check|缺少最终同余检查时的合数反例 9]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["ff00e4aa0ef74db8"]}